	<string id="st_shelter_note_text">
		<text>Whoever finds this, read it.\n\nWe found a proper bunker: thick walls, room for the whole group. But there's work up to our necks: rubble to clear, the corridors to look through.\n\nWe ordered a laptop from Sidorovich and paid in advance: someone has to go and fetch it. I keep its flash drive on me: the map of the rooms, the wiring and the rest. Without it we're blind kittens here.\n\nNothing to give us light: there's a generator, but it's dead. Lom went to Kardan at Yanov: he has the right tool kit and promised to lend it for old times' sake.\n\nWe'll sit tight a couple of days. My head has been splitting for two days now, and the dreams... Must be just tired.</text>
	</string>
